@startuml
title 46.5 y 46.6 - Estado y eliminación de restricción (ejemplo: zona restringida)

autonumber
hide footbox

actor "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API PROPUESTA\nPATCH status / DELETE restriction" as API
control "Lógica de aplicación propuesta\nNO IMPLEMENTADA" as App
database "PostgreSQL\n(db_script.sql)" as DB

note over Frontend, DB
Contrato propuesto. No existe backend implementado.
La DB no declara ON DELETE CASCADE para las tablas hijas.
Las búsquedas por ID son genéricas y no filtran restriction_type.
end note

alt Activar o desactivar 46.5
  Frontend -> API: PATCH /planning/restrictions/{restrictionId}/status\n{isActive}
  API -> App: validar path, JSON y booleano

  alt Solicitud mal formada
    App --> API: BAD_REQUEST o VALIDATION_ERROR
    API --> Frontend: 400 o 422\n{success: false, code, error}
  else Solicitud válida
    App -> DB: BEGIN
    App -> DB: SELECT id FROM planning_restrictions\nWHERE id = :restrictionId AND deleted_at IS NULL\nFOR UPDATE\n(sin filtro por restriction_type)
    DB --> App: fila o vacío

    alt No encontrada
      App -> DB: ROLLBACK
      App --> API: RESTRICTION_NOT_FOUND
      API --> Frontend: 404\n{success: false, code: 404, error}
    else Encontrada
      App -> DB: UPDATE planning_restrictions\nSET is_active = :isActive, updated_by, updated_at\nWHERE id = :restrictionId
      alt Falla la actualización
        DB --> App: error de persistencia
        App -> DB: ROLLBACK
        App --> API: INTERNAL_ERROR
        API --> Frontend: 500\n{success: false, code: 500, error: {type: INTERNAL_ERROR}}
      else Actualización exitosa
        App -> DB: COMMIT
        App --> API: {id, isActive, updatedBy, updatedAt}
        API --> Frontend: 200\n{success: true, code: 200, data}
      end
    end
  end
else Eliminación lógica 46.6
  Frontend -> API: DELETE /planning/restrictions/{restrictionId}
  API -> App: validar restrictionId BIGINT positivo

  alt Path no válido
    App --> API: BAD_REQUEST
    API --> Frontend: 400\n{success: false, code: 400, error}
  else Path válido
    App -> DB: BEGIN
    App -> DB: SELECT id FROM planning_restrictions\nWHERE id = :restrictionId AND deleted_at IS NULL\nFOR UPDATE\n(sin filtro por restriction_type)
    DB --> App: fila o vacío

    alt No encontrada o ya eliminada
      App -> DB: ROLLBACK
      App --> API: RESTRICTION_NOT_FOUND
      API --> Frontend: 404\n{success: false, code: 404, error}
    else Encontrada
      App -> DB: UPDATE planning_restriction_schedules\nSET deleted_at = :now, updated_by, updated_at\nWHERE planning_restriction_id = :restrictionId\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
      App -> DB: UPDATE planning_restriction_vehicle_rules\nSET deleted_at = :now, updated_by, updated_at\nWHERE planning_restriction_id = :restrictionId\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
      App -> DB: UPDATE planning_restrictions\nSET is_active = false, deleted_at = :now,\nupdated_by, updated_at\nWHERE id = :restrictionId

      alt Falla cualquier actualización
        DB --> App: error de persistencia
        App -> DB: ROLLBACK
        App --> API: INTERNAL_ERROR
        API --> Frontend: 500\n{success: false, code: 500, error: {type: INTERNAL_ERROR}}
      else Todas las actualizaciones son exitosas
        App -> DB: COMMIT
        App --> API: {id, isActive: false, deletedAt, auditoría}
        API --> Frontend: 200\n{success: true, code: 200, data}
      end
    end
  end
end

note over App, DB
La eliminación de hijos es una política de aplicación propuesta,
no una cascada garantizada por la base de datos.
end note

@enduml
